# Accountant queue presentation

Status: APPROVED, 2026-10-14. Authority: primary /root.
User supplied a screenshot of unstyled rows under «Очередь бухгалтера» and
requested improved appearance. This is a bounded presentation follow-up to
a99f72c7c72463943a96f15cae049d5d47630f18 on branch
fix/accounting-queue-ui-20261014.

Use the existing portal typography, tokens, Badge/Button/Panel components.
Replace bare paragraphs with a padded, divided, responsive list. Give clients
clear headings, distinguish repeated client names through deal reference and
available VIN, and show existing monetary values with accurate labels. Before
issuing an invoice the deal price is vehicle value, not a claimed invoice total;
for submitted payments show the claimed check amount. Separate the status and
right-aligned action; stack gracefully on narrow screens and wrap long values.
Add a compact queue count/description. Apply the same presentation to pending
B2B invoice rows in this page, without redesigning other financial panels.

Use only already-fetched Deal/Order/payment fields; no catalog requests or new
permissions. Preserve data filters, grouped-check deduplication, dialogs,
financial scopes, callbacks, history/read-only behavior and money arithmetic.
Missing optional snapshots must not break rendering or invent vehicle details.
No financial/backend/API/schema/product-policy changes.

Scoped paths: web/apps/portal/src/features/realization/pages/billing.tsx,
a local billing-queue.css, and minimal existing accountant.test.tsx assertions
if copy changes require it. No new cosmetic tests. Finish implementation first,
then run affected existing unit cases once. Latest pasted user policy permits
only affected units: no browser/E2E, lint, typecheck, build, React Doctor or
review/QA loops. No runtime/live-data/remote/production actions.

Source writer is reserved only after a bounded execution packet. Root owns
canonical records; worker owns source; version_control owns branch/commit.
Unrelated identity test and unread test_creds.txt are protected. Local commit
uses explicit paths and LEFTHOOK=0 to avoid unsolicited hook generation/checks.

User extension, 2026-10-14: «еще нужно убрать переключение между бухгалтером и
реализацией», accompanied by the sidebar showing those two section buttons.
Remove reciprocal same-company Accounting/Realization entries from the shared
sidebar switcher. When only that pair is available and no other company choices
exist, omit the whole section-switcher block. Other section/company choices,
direct routes, effective access and last-section selection are not changed by
this presentation request. Extra owned source path: web/packages/kit/src/portal.tsx.
No new cosmetic test; include existing portal.test.ts cases in final affected
unit verification. Implement after P1 releases the source writer.

